Package: nls-manager
Version: 0.1.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: NlsxNetOS contributors
Depends: nlsxnetos (>= 0.1.0), python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, policykit-1, systemd, python3-yaml
Description: NLS Manager graphical configuration application
 NLS Manager provides a graphical Ubuntu desktop control center for configuring,
 validating and monitoring the Network Layer Security components supplied by NlsxNetOS.
